    "head_branch": "claude/upbeat-babbage-3qmwcc",
    "head_commit_message": "feat(formation): the unit store's skeleton - every unit a slot, on both engines\n\nSpec 35 step 0 (Decision 142). UnitStore has two backends: UnitStoreGd, the\nreference, and UnitStoreNative, whose slots are the battle's BodyField bodies.\nA unit is enrolled when it spawns and dropped once no squad lists it; free slots\nare reused lowest first, and a slot never orders a loop or breaks a tie. The\nfield keeps a held unit's slot while it is off the field and enrols it again\nthere. The digest reads each unit's id through the store.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GQgzqqdjPY9H5H8VdRir2C",
    "head_sha": "eec27fb87a2263c33d101a546932b7f9427af7f7",
